browsing
  acts   enter open · f filter by · / filter · a all · e search · s sort · S save
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up]
  full   [ctrl+d half page down, ctrl+u half page up, g g first row, G / g e last row]
  full   [enter open, f filter by a person, a status, a label, / filter, a all issues, e edit this search, s sort, S save this query to a key]
a filter kept on the rows
  acts   enter open · f filter by · / filter · ctrl+g clear · a all · e search · s sort · S save
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up]
  full   [ctrl+d half page down, ctrl+u half page up, g g first row, G / g e last row]
  full   [enter open, f filter by a person, a status, a label, / filter, ctrl+g clear everything narrowing these rows, a all issues, e edit this search, s sort, S save this query to a key]
filter open
  acts   enter keep filter · esc clear filter
  full   [enter keep filter, esc clear filter]
  full   [alt+k delete to end of line]
picking the number key
  acts   1-9 the key to bind it to · esc leave it alone
  full   [1-9 the key to bind it to, esc leave it alone]
confirming a number key that is taken
  acts   y take the key · esc leave it alone
  full   [y take the key, esc leave it alone]
editing the search on screen
  acts   enter run this search · esc keep the one on screen
  full   [enter run this search, esc keep the one on screen]
  full   [alt+k delete to end of line]
choosing the order
  acts   ←/h prev · →/l next · enter choose this order · esc leave the order as it is
  full   [←/h previous field, →/l next field]
  full   [enter choose this order, esc leave the order as it is]
